{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1m5un3jrpcuoyX6gu3R", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off after filing two bugs; the developer confirmed both. Confidence is moderate (0.6), because some areas went untested.\n\n**Bugs filed**\n1. **Add note, note type not kept.** After choosing a different note type in Add note and leaving, reopening Add note shows \"Basic\" again. I reproduced it with \"Basic (and reversed card)\" and with \"Basic (type in the answer)\". The build is meant to store the switch straight away.\n2. **Create subdeck, whitespace accepted.** Typing only spaces enables Create and makes a junk subdeck named \"blank\" (Spanish::Nouns::blank). The top-level Create deck dialog keeps Create disabled for the same input.\n\n**Checked and fine**\n- **Set due date:** the day input gave 18 Nov for 5 days, and a 2–4 day range gave 15 Nov. Browser Due values and deck-list counts matched.\n- **Scheduling:** after answering two cards, the due dates and deck counts agreed.\n- **Notes:** adding \"gato\" and editing comer's back field both worked. The edit was still there after reopening, and the \"verb\" tag was intact.\n- **Statistics:** Future Due, Today, Calendar and Reviews matched the data in collection scope, and the screen held up in landscape.\n\n**Not covered:** deck rename and delete, filtered decks, undo of scheduling changes, and tag editing. I also didn't confirm whether \"Average: 0 reviews/day\" is right for 4 reviews over 30 days.\n\nI left test data behind: decks under Spanish (Verbs, blank, Nouns, Nouns::blank), the note \"gato\", an edit to comer, and changed due dates on agua, bonjour and mesa."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 487, "cache_read_input_tokens": 116344, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 487}, "output_tokens": 571, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "2beb34e2-8eb9-46c9-8af4-e8dc59cf2b55", "uuid": "03ce4cec-2c75-4b8d-8262-1637b2f4d181", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T23:02:32.719Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1m5uYAF72LkiYEwb3YY"}
